<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept deliveryTarget="except_print" id="t00087">
	<title>Tilt open/close</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>panorama sunroof 
					<indexterm>tilt open/close (front)</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00400">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00401">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25C045_1E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e00402">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25C049.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Push the sunroof switch upward, the sunroof glass tilts open. However, if the power sunshade is close, the sunshade will open first.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Push the sunroof switch upward or forward when the sunroof glass is tilt opened, the sunroof glass automatically closes.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>To stop the sunroof movement at any point, push the sunroof switch in any direction.</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>